# ─── KTX local state (never commit) ─────────────────────────
# Secrets (API keys, warehouse password), sqlite state/search indexes,
# caches, runtime daemon files, and generated agent bundles. A fresh
# clone rebuilds all of this with `ktx setup` + `ktx admin runtime install`.
.ktx/

# Note on raw-sources/: KTX versions its scan snapshots by design (the
# ingest pipeline batch-commits them; context reproducibility is the
# product's core contract, and there is no flag to disable it). They are
# therefore NOT ignored. Guardrails instead: ingest runs happen on
# feature branches (never on main), and .gitattributes marks the
# snapshots as linguist-generated so GitHub collapses them in PR diffs.
# See ADR-0013.
